{"html":"<p>Before Java 8, getting &quot;the names of customers who paid more than 35, sorted&quot; took a loop, an <code>if</code>, a temporary list and a sort. With streams it&#39;s one readable pipeline. To use streams you first need lambdas, so let&#39;s start there.</p>\n<h2 id=\"lambdas-functions-you-can-pass-around\">Lambdas: Functions You Can Pass Around</h2>\n<p>Sorting names without caring about upper and lower case used to need an anonymous class:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">names.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">new</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> Comparator&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">String</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">>() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">Override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> compare</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(String </span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">a</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, String </span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">b</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> a.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">compareToIgnoreCase</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(b);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">});</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>A lambda says the same thing with only the part that matters: the parameters, an arrow, and the result.</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">names.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">((a, b) </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">-></span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> a.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">compareToIgnoreCase</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(b));</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>When a lambda only calls one existing method, a <strong>method reference</strong> is even shorter:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">names.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(String</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">::</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">compareToIgnoreCase);</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><h3 id=\"functional-interfaces\">Functional Interfaces</h3>\n<p>A lambda can go wherever Java expects an interface with exactly one abstract method, called a functional interface. <code>Comparator</code> is one. The <code>java.util.function</code> package has the ones you&#39;ll meet most:</p>\n<div data-table-scroll><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Interface</th>\n<th>Takes</th>\n<th>Returns</th>\n<th>Example</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Predicate&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>T</code></td>\n<td><code>boolean</code></td>\n<td><code>s -&gt; s.length() &gt; 3</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Function&lt;T, R&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>T</code></td>\n<td><code>R</code></td>\n<td><code>String::length</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Consumer&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>T</code></td>\n<td>nothing</td>\n<td><code>System.out::println</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Supplier&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>nothing</td>\n<td><code>T</code></td>\n<td><code>ArrayList::new</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p>A lambda can read local variables from around it, but only if they&#39;re never changed after being set (&quot;effectively final&quot;). That rule prevents confusing bugs when the lambda runs later.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-example-data\">The Example Data</h2>\n<p>Every example below uses this list. A record is a short way to write a class that only holds data (Java 16 and later).</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">record</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(String customer, String city, </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">double</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> total, </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> paid) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">List</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">orders</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> List.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">of</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Ana\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Lyon\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Ben\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Paris\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">70</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Ana\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Lyon\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Chloé\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Paris\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">120</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Dan\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Nice\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">));</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><h2 id=\"a-stream-pipeline\">A Stream Pipeline</h2>\n<p>A stream pipeline has three parts: a source, any number of steps, and one final operation that produces the result.</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">List</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">String</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">bigPaid</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> orders.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()   </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// source</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Order</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">::</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">paid)                 </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// keep paid orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(o </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">-></span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> o.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">total</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">() </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">></span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 35</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">)         </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// and big ones</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">map</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Order</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">::</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">customer)                </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// keep only the name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">distinct</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()                          </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// remove duplicates</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">sorted</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()                            </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// A to Z</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">toList</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">();                           </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// final operation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(bigPaid); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// [Ana, Ben, Chloé]</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><ul>\n<li><code>filter</code> keeps the items for which the lambda returns <code>true</code>.</li>\n<li><code>map</code> turns each item into something else.</li>\n<li><code>toList()</code> (Java 16 and later) collects the result into a list you can&#39;t change. On older versions, use <code>.collect(Collectors.toList())</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The original list doesn&#39;t change. A stream reads its source and builds something new.</p>\n<h2 id=\"numbers-sum-average-max\">Numbers: Sum, Average, Max</h2>\n<p>For numbers, switch to a number stream with <code>mapToInt</code>, <code>mapToLong</code> or <code>mapToDouble</code>. It has <code>sum()</code>, <code>average()</code>, <code>min()</code> and <code>max()</code>:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">double</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> revenue</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> orders.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Order</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">::</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">paid)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">mapToDouble</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Order</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">::</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">total)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(revenue); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// 260.0</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p><code>reduce</code> combines all items into one, starting from a first value:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">int</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> Stream.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">of</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">).</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, Integer</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">::</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">sum); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// 10</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p><code>IntStream.range</code> replaces many counting loops:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">List</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">Integer</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">squares</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> IntStream.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">rangeClosed</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">map</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">-></span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">*</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">boxed</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">toList</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// [1, 4, 9, 16, 25]</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><h2 id=\"grouping-with-collectors\">Grouping With Collectors</h2>\n<p><code>Collectors.groupingBy</code> is like <code>GROUP BY</code> in SQL. It builds a map from a key to the items that share it, and a second collector says what to do with each group:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">Map</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">String</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">, </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">Long</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">countByCity</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> orders.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">collect</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Collectors.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">groupingBy</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Order</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">::</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">city, Collectors.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">counting</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// {Lyon=2, Paris=2, Nice=1}, in any order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">Map</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">String</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">, </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">Double</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">totalByCity</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> orders.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">collect</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Collectors.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">groupingBy</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Order</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">::</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">city, TreeMap</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">::new</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">        Collectors.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">summingDouble</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Order</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">::</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">total)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// {Lyon=55.0, Nice=30.0, Paris=190.0}, sorted by city</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>Passing <code>TreeMap::new</code> gives a map sorted by key. Without it, you get a <code>HashMap</code> in no particular order.</p>\n<p>Two more collectors you&#39;ll use often:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// Split into two groups: true and false.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">Map</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">Boolean</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">, </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">List</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">String</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">>> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">paidOrNot</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> orders.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">collect</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Collectors.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">partitioningBy</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Order</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">::</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">paid,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">        Collectors.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">mapping</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Order</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">::</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">customer, Collectors.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">toList</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">())));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(paidOrNot.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">get</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">)); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// [Ana]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// Join strings.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">String</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> names</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> orders.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">map</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Order</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">::</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">customer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">distinct</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">collect</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Collectors.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">joining</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\", \"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">)); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// Ana, Ben, Chloé, Dan</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><h2 id=\"sorting-by-several-fields\">Sorting by Several Fields</h2>\n<p><code>Comparator.comparing</code> builds a comparator from a field, and <code>thenComparing</code> breaks ties:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">List</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">sorted</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> orders.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">sorted</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Comparator.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">comparing</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Order</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">::</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">city)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">thenComparing</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Order</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">::</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">total, Comparator.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">reverseOrder</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">toList</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// Lyon 40, Lyon 15, Nice 30, Paris 120, Paris 70</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><h2 id=\"optional-when-there-might-be-no-result\">Optional: When There Might Be No Result</h2>\n<p><code>max</code>, <code>min</code> and <code>findFirst</code> might find nothing, so they return an <code>Optional</code>: a box that holds a value or is empty. It makes you decide what happens when it&#39;s empty, instead of getting a <code>NullPointerException</code> later.</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">String</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> biggest</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> orders.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">max</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Comparator.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">comparingDouble</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Order</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">::</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">total))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">map</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(Order</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">::</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">customer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">orElse</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"nobody\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// Chloé</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">Optional</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">inRome</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> orders.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(o </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">-></span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> o.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">city</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">().</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">equals</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Rome\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">findFirst</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(inRome.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">isPresent</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// false</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>Avoid calling <code>get()</code> on an <code>Optional</code> without checking first: it throws when the box is empty. Use <code>orElse</code>, <code>orElseThrow</code> or <code>ifPresent</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"streams-are-lazy\">Streams Are Lazy</h2>\n<p>The steps don&#39;t run until the final operation asks for a result. Then each item goes through all the steps, one at a time, and the stream stops as soon as it can:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">Stream</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">String</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> Stream.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">of</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"a\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"b\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"c\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">peek</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(s </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">-></span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"looking at \"</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> s))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(s </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">-></span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> s.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">equals</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"b\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"nothing printed yet\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(stream.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">findFirst</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">().</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">get</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">());</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>nothing printed yet</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>looking at a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>looking at b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>b</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p><code>&quot;c&quot;</code> is never looked at: <code>findFirst</code> already had its answer.</p>\n<h2 id=\"mistakes-to-avoid\">Mistakes to Avoid</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Using a stream twice.</strong> A stream can only be used once. A second final operation throws <code>IllegalStateException: stream has already been operated upon or closed</code>. Call <code>orders.stream()</code> again instead.</li>\n<li><strong>Changing things from inside a lambda.</strong> Adding to an outside list from <code>forEach</code> or <code>map</code> works by accident and breaks with parallel streams. Let the stream build the result with <code>toList()</code> or a collector.</li>\n<li><strong>Streams for everything.</strong> A simple loop with an early <code>return</code>, or one that changes several variables, is often clearer as a loop. Use streams when the steps read like a sentence.</li>\n<li><strong><code>parallelStream()</code> to go faster.</strong> It helps only for large amounts of CPU-heavy work, and it can be slower on small lists. Measure before you use it.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"the-answer-in-short\">The Answer in Short</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>A lambda is a short function: <code>(a, b) -&gt; a + b</code>. A method reference, like <code>Order::total</code>, is shorter still.</li>\n<li>A stream is a source, then steps (<code>filter</code>, <code>map</code>, <code>sorted</code>, <code>distinct</code>), then one final operation (<code>toList</code>, <code>sum</code>, <code>collect</code>, <code>findFirst</code>).</li>\n<li>Use <code>mapToDouble(…).sum()</code> for numbers, <code>groupingBy</code> for groups and <code>joining</code> for text.</li>\n<li><code>Optional</code> means &quot;maybe no result&quot;: finish it with <code>orElse</code> or <code>orElseThrow</code>.</li>\n<li>Streams are lazy and single-use, and they never change their source.</li>\n</ol>\n"}